  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• To a medium heatproof bowl, add couscous and the salt.\n• Add the boiling water (see ingredients) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e050d0527cba53b2ce4/step-de709200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Drain chickpeas.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes. Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine hummus, harissa paste and a splash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e050d0527cba53b2ce4/step-5d914e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas until slightly tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add the butter, paprika spice blend and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e050d0527cba53b2ce4/step-144f7320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine a good squeeze of lemon juice, a good drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• To the dressing, add couscous, cucumber, tomatoes and rocket leaves. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide couscous salad between bowls, then top with haloumi and paprika spiced chickpeas.\n• Drizzle over harissa hummus and garnish with pepitas. Serve with remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e050d0527cba53b2ce4/step-6ffe7330.jpg"
    }
  ]
